            "Black Beauty let scientists “touch” the primitive crust of Mars and better understand the history of water on the Red Planet; it has become an icon among collectors of Martian meteorites. It is said to give courage, determination and a spirit of exploration, like Mars, god of war. It is associated with the root and solar plexus chakras and the sign of Aries (ruled by Mars). Keep dry, in a box with label and certificate; do not wet; handle with tweezers; cleanse by smudging from a distance."
